CORE
explicit_x_two_state_conversion.sv
--top main --bound 3
^\[main\.c_a\] .*: PROVED up to bound 3$
^\[main\.c_b\] .*: PROVED up to bound 3$
^\[main\.c_c\] .*: PROVED up to bound 3$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
An explicit two-state conversion of a value with x gives 0 for the x bits,
also when the result is written by an always construct.
